# `no Override o where o.zone == d.zone` -- the NOT node.
#
# A DoorOpen with no Override fires the alert. Then an Override arrives and the
# rule must NOT fire again; then the Override is retracted and it must be
# eligible once more. This is the one path where an ASSERT withdraws an
# activation and a RETRACT creates one.
assert DoorOpen ts=1 zone=kitchen
pump
assert Override zone=kitchen
pump
retract 1
pump
